  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Suriname Global Fund Country Coordination Mechanism (CCM) for the duration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to ensure effective functioning of the CCM Suriname in accordance with the GFATM Guidelines and Requirements for CCMs. Country Coordinating Mechanisms are national committees that submit funding applications for HIV, Tuberculosis and Malaria to the Global Fund (GF) and oversee grants on behalf of their countries.</narrative>
  </description>
